                    },
                    "message": "In case if we run /tmp/bmcweb for testing, it may collide the default state file.\nBut, this can be overridden via an environment variable - STATE_DIRECTORY (with this code). Is it better to state this in the commit message about\n```\nSTATE_DIRECTORY=/tmp /tmp/bmcweb \n```"
